<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">VISION TO MOVEMENT</view><view class="title">课堂背后的计算</view><view class="subtitle">图像在板端处理，运动结果在这里呈现</view><demo-notice/><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="refresh">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在读取接入状态…</view><block wx:if="{{device}}"><view class="card"><view class="row"><text class="name">小程序数据来源</text><text class="pill offline">{{isDemo?'本地演示':'已配置服务'}}</text></view><view class="hint">{{isDemo?'当前使用合成课堂样本，没有连接FPGA或RK。学生、评分和动作事件不是真实识别结果。':'设备状态与性能以配置服务返回数据为准。'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{device.test_service}}" class="card"><view class="name">本地测试服务已连接</view><view class="hint">人工计数联调；FPGA、RK与相机均未连接。</view></view><view class="section">系统设计链路 <text class="section-note">目标架构</text></view><view class="card"><view class="step" wx:for="{{nodes}}" wx:key="name"><view class="row"><text class="name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="pill {{item.status==='online'?'':'offline'}}">{{item.label}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.role}}</view></view><view class="hint">各处理模块、双摄并发和整链性能需要独立实机验证，此图不代表功能已验收。</view></view><view class="section">数据如何到达小程序</view><view class="card"><view class="list-row"><view class="name">FPGA → RK3576J</view><view class="muted">板内高速接口 · 图像与压缩数据</view></view><view class="list-row"><view class="name">RK → Windows</view><view class="muted">以太网 / 局域网 · 网页端图像与处理效果展示</view></view><view class="list-row"><view class="name">小程序 → 数据服务</view><view class="muted">HTTPS查询档案 · WSS按需更新课堂</view></view><view class="list-row"><view class="name">数据服务 → AI建议服务</view><view class="muted">后端受控调用 · 去标识化统计</view></view><view class="hint">校外访问需部署远程数据服务。蓝牙不作为默认数据通道。</view></view></block></view>
